                <invention-title lang="de">HIN- UND HERGEHENDES WERKZEUG MIT PLANETENGETRIEBE UND GEGENGEWICHTSANORDNUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">OUTIL À MOUVEMENT ALTERNATIF AYANT UN ENSEMBLE ENGRENAGE PLANÉTAIRE ET ENSEMBLE CONTREPOIDS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">RECIPROCATING TOOL HAVING PLANETARY GEAR ASSEMBLY AND COUNTERWEIGHTING ASSEMBLY</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A power-driven reciprocating tool may include a transmission mechanism that converts rotational force from a motor to linear force to be output by a reciprocating mechanism coupled thereto, and a counterbalancing mechanism coupled to the transmission mechanism to counter-balance forces generated by the reciprocating mechanism. The transmission mechanism may include a planetary gear assembly including a sun gear in meshed engagement with at least one planet gear. In response to a force converted by and transmitted from the transmission mechanism, the reciprocating mechanism may move in a first linear direction, and the counterbalancing mechanism may move in a second linear direction, opposite the first linear direction. The opposite linear movement of the reciprocating mechanism and the counterbalancing mechanism may counteract forces generated by the reciprocating motion of the reciprocating mechanism, thus reducing vibration output by the tool.</p>
            </abstract>
